<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-KOHL BACKS GERMAN WORLD CUP BID.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KOHL BACKS GERMAN WORLD CUP BID.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Chancellor Helmut Kohl, an avid soccer fan, gave his full backing to his country's bid for the 2006 World Cup on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are arguing with Britain. I'm in favour of it taking place in Germany. It's as simple as that,&quot; said Kohl, a personal friend of national team coach Berti Vogts.</p>
<p>The Germans are caught up in a row over the bidding for the event with UEFA and England.</p>
</text>
